        "fullDesc": "### What is Neuromodulation?\nFor selected chronic pain syndromes, neuromodulation, such as spinal cord stimulation (SCS), can be considered after careful consideration. The aim is to influence pain processing through targeted electrical stimulation of nerve pathways. Complete freedom from pain cannot be guaranteed.\n\nIn chronic, treatment-refractory pain syndromes, electrodes are placed in the epidural space. Light electrical impulses superimpose the pain signals on their way to the brain.\n\n### Sequence\n<div",
